{"id":"59ee0c08880a79d3","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-doob-convergence.md","title":"Doob Convergence","display":"thm-doob-convergence — Doob Convergence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-doob-convergence","aliases":["58-thm-doob-convergence"],"display":"thm-doob-convergence — Doob Convergence","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-martingale.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-uniform-integrability.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-doob-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-doob-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-doob-convergence — Doob Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"51dcf9111a1a952a\" href=\"?note=51dcf9111a1a952a\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-martingale.md\">../batch17/58-df-martingale.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ddc9021c037117b\" href=\"?note=5ddc9021c037117b\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-uniform-integrability.md\">../batch20/58-df-uniform-integrability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5795bc870ceffc9\" href=\"?note=b5795bc870ceffc9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md\">../batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\">\\((\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (probability space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(\\mathcal F_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\(\\mathcal F=(\\mathcal F_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> (filtration), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(M_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\">\\(M=(M_n)_{n\\in\\omega}\\)</span> (real-valued process)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S,\\operatorname{UI}_S,\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Martingale}_S,\\operatorname{UI}_S,\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}doob-convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\operatorname{UI}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(M);\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\to\\exists M_\\infty\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S(M,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}doob-convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\operatorname{UI}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(M);\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\to\\exists M_\\infty\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S(M,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The martingale hypothesis is essential; uniform integrability of an arbitrary sequence alone does not imply convergence.</li>\n<li>The probability space is passed to the exact uniform-integrability predicate, and the conclusion delegates measurability, integrability, almost-sure convergence, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^1\">\\(L^1\\)</span> convergence to the canonical convergence predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-martingale.md","status":"resolved","id":"51dcf9111a1a952a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-martingale.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-uniform-integrability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5ddc9021c037117b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-uniform-integrability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5795bc870ceffc9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-martingale-convergence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(\\mathcal F_n)_{n\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"M=(M_n)_{n\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Martingale}_S,\\operatorname{UI}_S,\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}doob-convergence} \\vdash \\mathrm{Martingale}_S(M,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P,\\omega)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(M,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\operatorname{UI}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(M);\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)\\to\\exists M_\\infty\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\;\\mathrm{UIConvergentMartingale}_S(M,M_\\infty,\\mathcal F,\\Omega,\\mathcal A,\\mathbb P)","display":true},{"tex":"L^1","display":false}],"bytes":1482,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-doob-convergence.md|58-thm-doob-convergence]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["51dcf9111a1a952a","5ddc9021c037117b","b5795bc870ceffc9","36d7463d215be751"]}